OL,3,AFontaines D.C.'s frontman on why he
OL,4,Awore semi-pro football club's shirt at
OL,5,AReading Festival
OL,6,
OL,7,FFontaines D.C.'s frontman has revealed
OL,8,Fwhy he wore the shirt of a little-known
OL,9,FWelsh football club during the band's
OL,10,FReading Festival headline set.
OL,12,FGrian Chatten, lead singer of the Irish
OL,13,Ffive-piece rock band, was seen sporting
OL,14,Fa green and white-striped Cwmbran
OL,15,FCeltic away shirt during the
OL,16,Fperformance.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
